    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85339" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-σπερής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wide-spread, spread over the earth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρωποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.804
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.365
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὠκεανῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					365
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theodect.
					16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνόδοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.577
				</span></i>
			; 
				Boeot.
			 pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολουσπερίες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Corinn.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					2.63
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fruitful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμασῆνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					74
				</span></i>
			.</div>
